<title>SWEDEN: Atlas Copco 9-mo results late Thursday.</title>
<headline>Atlas Copco 9-mo results late Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlas Copco plans to announce its nine-month results between 1630 and 1700 GMT on Thursday, the company said.</p>
<p>The relatively late release is because the company's board is meeting in the U.S., information director Carl-Johan Wachtmeister told Reuters.</p>
<p>Atlas Copco is expected to show a profit after financial items of 2.22 billion crowns, according to a Reuter poll of 13 analysts.</p>
<p>-- Lena Torlegard 08-700 1018</p>
</text>
